{
  "private": true,
  "name": "@injishi/product-pms",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Injishi PMS (ADR-074): the screens of reservations, the front desk, stays and guests, folios and the night audit, housekeeping, maintenance, rates, the listing and revenue, and the guest's and the staff's phones. Views and the shapes they draw, with no authority, no secrets and no database: the app mounts the views on its routes and hands them their data, links, actions and photographs.",
